ARCHITECTURE (mirrors the A7 ChargingCurve / Statistics precedents)
  DrivesListPageModel.kt      framework-free: registration ids; the verbatim port of
                              web/src/lib/drivesAggregation.ts (getEfficiency,
                              gradeFromEfficiency/gradeFromNumeric, computePeriodStats,
                              priorPeriod, detectAnomalies/detectNotable/detectCommutes,
                              groupByDate, dailyTrend, localDayKey) + the page-local
                              useMemo chain (deriveDrivesListData), DrivesListInteraction,
                              DrivesDisplayPrefs (web useUnits/useFormatting), view.opened.
  DrivesListPageSource.kt     seam over DrivingRepository.drives (web useDrives) +
                              bulkDeleteDrives (web useBulkDeleteDrives, DELETE /drives/bulk)
                              + SettingsStore.settings + SelectedVehicleStore.
  DrivesListPageViewModel.kt  BaseFeedViewModel; drivesState: StateFlow<UiState<List<Drive>>>
                              gated on the active vehicle (web useSelectedVehicle); displayPrefs
                              StateFlow; sort/collection/trend/page/search/bulk-select actions;
                              deleteSelected mutation; refresh/retry.
  DrivesListPage.kt           stateful entry + stateless content; loading/empty/error/success;
                              the overview KPI card (6 metric tiles + no-stats panel), the
                              MetricSwitcherChart, the collections pill row, the sort controls,
                              the bulk-selectable date-grouped list + pagination.
  DrivesListPageHost.kt       DrivesListRoute + DrivesListPageHost.register() for the
                              `drives` / `/drives` destination (Destinations.kt L67;
                              registered in TeslaSyncApplication.kt).

DATA SOURCES (each bound through the ViewModel's StateFlow over the KMP core, P1/S8)
  useDrives             → DrivingRepository.drives(vehicleId)  → drivesState
  useBulkDeleteDrives   → DrivingRepository.bulkDeleteDrives(ids) (DELETE /drives/bulk) → deleteSelected()

SI BOUNDARY (P1/S5)
  Aggregation stays SI end to end (meters, m/s, Wh, seconds). Display conversion happens only at
  the render boundary via DrivesDisplayPrefs.toDistance/toSpeed/toEfficiency + formatCurrency/
  formatEnergyCost (convertDistanceFromSI/convertSpeedFromSI from the shared units module).

